    "{i}何日もの旅の果てに…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3530
translate ja qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_b0ee4ab2:

    # "The great free city of Hamun laid stretched before us, a shining coastal oasis beside the roaring desert dunes."
    "偉大なる自由都市ハムンが、轟く砂漠の砂丘の傍らに、輝く海岸のオアシスとして我々の前に広がっていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3531
translate ja qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_12c7f6f4:

    # "Now under the control of the powerful merchant lords, the city had flourished into one of great splendour... And danger."
    "今や有力な商人貴族の支配下に置かれ、この都市は大いなる繁栄を遂げていた…そして危険をも内包するものに。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3532
translate ja qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_9a6564ac:

    # "For beneath it's shiny exterior, there were no {i}laws{/i} as such anymore in Hamun,"
    "なぜなら、その煌びやかな外見の下では、ハムンにはもはや{i}法{/i}というものは存在しなくなっていたからだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3533
translate ja qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_72f3238d:

    # "Only the many armed guards the various merchant factions paid to maintain their control gave some semblance of peace."
    "商人ギルドの権勢を支えるために雇われた、数多の武器を携えた護衛兵だけが、かろうじて平穏の仮面を保っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3537
translate ja qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_b2cbe1ec:

    # "But beyond the ever looming threat not to to cause unncessary trouble, the city was truly free."
    "しかし、不必要なトラブルを引き起こさぬよう常につきまとう脅威を除けば、この街は真に自由だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3540
translate ja qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_7b096b57:

    # GUARD "HALT!"
    GUARD "待て!"

